        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/5c3e5008564c0836400a39b3dd39a8bf.avif?t=1787610774\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras_big/5c3e5008564c0836400a39b3dd39a8bf.webp?t=1787610774 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to rise as a legendary hero in a relentless adventure where precision, speed, and courage define your fate. Every jump matters. Every decision counts. This is not just a platformer—it’s a true test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intense action, razor-sharp platforming, and expertly crafted challenges designed to push your reflexes to their absolute limit. Intelligent enemies hunt you down, adapting to your every move, while powerful bosses demand focus, strategy, and flawless execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic Hop delivers a vibrant world filled with charm—but don’t be deceived. Beneath its colorful style lies a demanding experience that rewards mastery, determination, and persistence. Every victory is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in. Rise up. Prove you have what it takes to become a true hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/16b20f41001bb204aab34ada56d4be27.avif?t=1787610774\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras_big/16b20f41001bb204aab34ada56d4be27.webp?t=1787610774 width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Precise and responsive 2D platforming controls<br>• Challenging traps, collapsing terrain, and vertical level design<br>• Smart enemies that track, react, and pressure the player<br>• Dynamic platforms that move, rotate, rise, and fall<br>• A rewarding difficulty curve that pushes your skills forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English, Spanish, Portuguese, German, French, and Italian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/bf60f5acfb6c3710774093b7107726a5.avif?t=1787610774\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras_big/bf60f5acfb6c3710774093b7107726a5.webp?t=1787610774 width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/5c3e5008564c0836400a39b3dd39a8bf.avif?t=1787610774\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras_big/5c3e5008564c0836400a39b3dd39a8bf.webp?t=1787610774 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to rise as a legendary hero in a relentless adventure where precision, speed, and courage define your fate. Every jump matters. Every decision counts. This is not just a platformer—it’s a true test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intense action, razor-sharp platforming, and expertly crafted challenges designed to push your reflexes to their absolute limit. Intelligent enemies hunt you down, adapting to your every move, while powerful bosses demand focus, strategy, and flawless execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic Hop delivers a vibrant world filled with charm—but don’t be deceived. Beneath its colorful style lies a demanding experience that rewards mastery, determination, and persistence. Every victory is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in. Rise up. Prove you have what it takes to become a true hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/16b20f41001bb204aab34ada56d4be27.avif?t=1787610774\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras_big/16b20f41001bb204aab34ada56d4be27.webp?t=1787610774 width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Precise and responsive 2D platforming controls<br>• Challenging traps, collapsing terrain, and vertical level design<br>• Smart enemies that track, react, and pressure the player<br>• Dynamic platforms that move, rotate, rise, and fall<br>• A rewarding difficulty curve that pushes your skills forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English, Spanish, Portuguese, German, French, and Italian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/bf60f5acfb6c3710774093b7107726a5.avif?t=1787610774\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras_big/bf60f5acfb6c3710774093b7107726a5.webp?t=1787610774 width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
